- rule BloC
    
    Viết Bloc đủ 3 state Loading, Success ( ko dùng loaded) , Error phải có đủ Try, catch nên tìm lỗi cụ thể nếu được  , tuân theo form ví dụ này : 
    
 
    import 'package:flutter_bloc/flutter_bloc.dart';
    import 'package:XXXX/presentation/bloc/statistics/statistics_event.dart';
    import 'package:XXXX/presentation/bloc/statistics/statistics_state.dart';
    class StatisticsBloc extends Bloc<StatisticsEvent, StatisticsState> {
      StatisticsBloc()
        : super(
            StatisticsInitial(
              startDate: DateTime.now(),
              selectedTimeRange: TimeRange.week,
              allDataOrder: [],
              dataAnalysisDay: [],
              selectedIndexInDisplayedData: 0,
            ),
          ) {
        on<LoadOrdersEvent>(_onLoadOrders);
       
      }
    
       Future<void> _onLoadOrders(
        LoadOrdersEvent event,
        Emitter<StatisticsState> emit,
      ) async {
        emit(StatisticsLoading.fromState(state: state));
        try {
          final updatedOrders = await getIt<OrderDataService>().getOrdersAPI();
          if (updatedOrders.isEmpty) {
            throw Exception('No orders found or data is null');
          }
          final updatedDailyData = StatisticsHelper.aggregateDailyData(
            updatedOrders,
          );
          emit(StatisticsSuccess.fromState(state: state));
          if (state is StatisticsSuccess) {
            final successState = state as StatisticsSuccess;
            emit(
              successState.copyWith(
                allDataOrder: updatedOrders,
                dataAnalysisDay: updatedDailyData,
              ),
            );
          }
        } catch (e, stackTrace) {
          String errorMessage;
          if (e is TimeoutException) {
            errorMessage = 'Thời gian yêu cầu quá lâu: ${e.message}';
          }
          else {
            errorMessage = 'Lỗi không xác định: ${e.toString()}';
          }
          customPrint('Stack trace: $stackTrace');
          emit(StatisticsError(errorMessage: errorMessage));
        }
      }
    
    ```
    
- rule Event
    
    Bắt buộc phải có đuôi là Event. ( ví dụ SetTime → SetTimeEvent , TestFunction → TestFunctionEvent) viết abstract ví dụ SampleEvent, các Event khác Extend từ abtract event extends từ Equatable ) 

    
    abstract class StatisticsEvent extends Equatable {
      const StatisticsEvent();
      @override
      List<Object?> get props => [];
    }
    class SetTimeRangeEvent extends StatisticsEvent {
      final TimeRange timeRange;
    
      const SetTimeRangeEvent(this.timeRange);
    
      @override
      List<Object?> get props => [timeRange];
    }
